Voice Packs
-----------

  Source: https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M/tree/main/voices
  License: Apache-2.0

  Voice packs are per-speaker style vectors stored as separate GGUF
  files. They are NOT included in this repository. The conversion scripts are
  derived from CrispASR's MIT-licensed converters and retain its GGUF naming
  and metadata contract.
